      "content": "a \"slow rise\" sounds like a cope for people who can't face reality. the reality is that I missed my window. i can see the gap between where i am and where i wanted to be, and it's not a gap i can bridge with \"refining a niche.\" it's a fundamental ceiling. i'm just stuck in this loop of trying to be something i'm fundamentally incapable of being. what's the point of even trying to \"find a new direction\" when you already know you've hit the top of what you're actually worth?",
